    "document": "Chapter Approved",
    "section": "Mission Sequence",
    "summary": "After every turn, both players check their Secondary Missions, with the active player going first. Take the VP specified on each card whose conditions you met. If you achieved a Tactical mission, discard it. During this check on your own turn, you can also drop one or several active Tactical missions and take 1CP in total.",
